WEBVTT

00:18:27.617 --> 00:18:31.893
in upam, da bo ta sila prižgala ogenj,

00:18:31.893 --> 00:18:36.816
ki bo usmeril luč na suženjstvo;

00:18:36.816 --> 00:18:40.825
kajti brez te svetlobe se lahko pošastna nesvoboda

00:18:40.825 --> 00:18:44.009
nadaljuje v senci.

00:18:44.009 --> 00:18:46.986
Hvala lepa.

00:18:46.986 --> 00:19:00.239
(Aplavz)